  "limitations": [
    "P04 push (D034): this is a re-review of a chunk that completed earlier on an 8/10 review accepted under D034. It must now pass the full 9/10 gate before the P04 phase review. The tree under review is the current integrated tree (C13-C15 and their follow-up remediation); the chunk's follow-ups file (docs/planning/reviews/<chunk>/follow-ups.md) lists each prior finding and how and where it was remediated, with the guarding tests and probes. Earlier attempts' verdicts are retained.",
